▶ ASAMA_04: replay proof, V2 token ve attempt fencing
  ✔ V2 tokens are stable for the stored nonce and change after tombstone GC (5.403ms)
  ✔ only the same owner, proof and payload can recover a ready reservation (1.7ms)
  ✔ legacy requestId-only records never regenerate a manage token (0.5019ms)
  ✔ a failed operation retries as a new fenced attempt while preserving its logical tokens (1.0109ms)
  ✔ expired lease takeover fences late finalize and revoke cannot be undone (0.9941ms)
  ✔ 20 simultaneous replays create one logical reservation without UNIQUE failures (2.312ms)
  ✔ 20 parallel requests against isolated PostgreSQL use ON CONFLICT and create one row (1692.6335ms)
  ✔ status GET requires cookie and proof, returns ready tokens without any form fields and is no-store (12.7065ms)
Belge paylaşım oluşturma beklenmeyen hata kategorisi: Error
  ✔ Blob PUT sonrası finalize hatası failed olur; aynı payload yeni path ile retry edilir (233.668ms)
  ✔ finalize commit yanıtı kaybolursa genel hata hazır kaydı failed yapmaz (15.4637ms)
  ✔ unavailable stored key version fails closed rather than changing old token hashes (0.895ms)
✔ ASAMA_04: replay proof, V2 token ve attempt fencing (1968.8014ms)
